{"id":"4F","title":"Justice In Law and Judgment","part":{"n":4,"title":"Law and Justice"},"url":"/law/04-law-and-justice/4f","entries":[{"id":"4F.1","text":"You are not to twist, distort or pervert justice.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":16,"verses":"19"}],"citation":"Deut 16:19."},{"id":"4F.2","text":"You shall not be unjust but shall follow that which is just and righteous in matters of law and judgment.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"15,35"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":16,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":22,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Lev. 19:15,35; Deut 16:20; Jer. 22:3."},{"id":"4F.3","text":"You are not to be partial towards anyone or a respecter of persons in exacting justice, whether they be poor or rich, small or great.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":23,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"15"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":16,"verses":"19"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":19,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":28,"verses":"21"}],"citation":"Exod. 23:3; Lev. 19:15: Deut. 16:19; 2 Chron. 19:7; Prov. 28:21."},{"id":"4F.4","text":"Judgment to be quickly executed upon those violating the law of God or the law of the land.","refs":[{"book":"Ezra","chapter":7,"verses":"26"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":21,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"Ezra. 7:26; Jer. 21:12."},{"id":"4F.5","text":"Seek good, and not evil; hate the evil, and love the good, and establish justice in your courts.","refs":[{"book":"Amos","chapter":5,"verses":"14-15"}],"citation":"Amos 5:14-15."},{"id":"4F.6","text":"You shall keep far from a false matter.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":23,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"Exod. 23:7."},{"id":"4F.7","text":"Injustice of the least kind is condemned.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":16,"verses":"10"}],"citation":"Luke 16:10."},{"id":"4F.8","text":"You shall do no injustice regarding the measurement of length, weight or volume, but shall adhere to a just and standard measurement.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"35-36"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":82,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Lev. 19:35-36; Psa. 82:2."},{"id":"4F.9","text":"They are condemned who call evil good, and good evil.","refs":[{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":5,"verses":"20"}],"citation":"Isa. 5:20."},{"id":"4F.10","text":"We are commanded to act justly and pursue justice.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":16,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":21,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":56,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Micah","chapter":6,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Philippians","chapter":4,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Deut 16:20; Prov. 21:3: Isa. 56:1; Mic. 6:8; Phil. 4:8."},{"id":"4F.11","text":"You shall not pervert the judgment of the stranger, the widow, the oppressed nor of the fatherless.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":22,"verses":"21-23"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":24,"verses":"17"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":27,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":10,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":82,"verses":"2-4"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":1,"verses":"17"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":22,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Exod 22:21-23; Deut 24:17; Deut. 27:19; Psa. 10:18; Psa. 82:2-4; Isa. 1:17; Jer. 22:3."},{"id":"4F.12","text":"You shall not pervert judgment of the poor or needy in his cause but judge them righteously and deliver them out of the hand of the wicked.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":23,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":29,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":82,"verses":"2-4"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":31,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Exod. 23:6; Prov. 29:4; Psa. 82:2-4; Prov. 31:9."},{"id":"4F.13","text":"Doing injustice by justifying the wicked and condemning the righteous is an abomination and condemned by God.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":17,"verses":"15"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":18,"verses":"5"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":20,"verses":"10"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":24,"verses":"24-25"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":29,"verses":"27"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":82,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Lamentations","chapter":3,"verses":"35-36"},{"book":"Micah","chapter":3,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Prov. 17:15; Prov. 18:5; Prov. 20:10; Prov. 24:24-25; Prov. 29:27; Psa. 82:2; Lam. 3:35-36; Mic. 3:9."},{"id":"4F.14","text":"Blessed are those who keep justice.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":106,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Psa. 106:3."},{"id":"4F.15","text":"Punishment required for injustice.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":11,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Amos","chapter":5,"verses":"11-12"}],"citation":"Prov. 11:7; Amos 5:11-12."},{"id":"4F.16","text":"You shall not turn aside the needy from judgment, or take away the rights from the poor by unrighteous decrees.","refs":[{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":10,"verses":"1-2"}],"citation":"Isa. 10: 1 -2."},{"id":"4F.17","text":"When the wicked surround the righteous, the law becomes ignored, justice is never upheld, and wrong judgment is rendered.","refs":[{"book":"Habakkuk","chapter":1,"verses":"4"}],"citation":"Hab. 1:4."}]}